column7:
- ZP contestant (29) 5th position; 
 - Sarpanch (2006-11) 
 - Mukhiya (2011-16)

-Incumbent Panchayat Samiti (2021)

-in 2011 contested for Panchayat samiti and secured 3rd position;

-in 2016 contested for panchayat Samiti and secured 2nd position; 

-his husband is a Clerk in DEO Office Sitamarhi

 -PACs 1st runner up (2019)

-his brother was contested for Mukhiya in 2021 but lost; 

-Medicine Shop at Minapur Balha Bazar
